[s46] Configure Claude Code for Sovereign46
[s46] harness: claude-code (would write ~/.claude/settings.json)
  - set apiKeyHelper to 's46 token --refresh'
  - set ANTHROPIC_BASE_URL to https://acme.s46.dev/anthropic
  - set default Claude model aliases to s46/kimi-k2.6

--- ~/.claude/settings.json
+++ ~/.claude/settings.json
@@ -1,0 +1,9 @@
